        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v65" value="Concurrency: two confirmations arriving together both try stream_seq n+1; the unique (stream_id, stream_seq) key lets one commit and the other is re-read and retried (409 stale). Outcomes are written in the same transaction as the close, so a loan is never closed without its outcomes; outcome (source_event_id, subject_id, metric) is unique, so a retry never double-counts. Trust-edge weight: recency-weighted Beta posterior mean (ADR-0006)." style="shape=note;size=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#B26A00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="2068" width="1580" height="46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
